    "updated_at": "2022-04-26T16:54:36Z",
    "body": "Yeah, seems like a reasonable thing to fix.\r\n\r\nI suppose an argument could be made that how `maxlength` is enforced for user input is a UI decision and browsers should be allowed to decide how to trim excessive inputs. (Websites could grab the paste event and set `value` directly if they don't like that.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
